4. DEPTH-RANGE MATCHING (fact 50)
   113 covers 112's frames 5.5 -> 66.6 of 0 -> 78.
   112 restricted to indices 6..67 (62 frames); 113 uses all 63.

5. DECODE + MERGE (m41lib.arm_A, imported frozen)
   112: 62 frames x 2 ROIs in 29.5s
   113: 63 frames x 2 ROIs in 29.2s
   arm A 112 detail: mean n_eff = 10.366
   arm A 112 flat  : mean n_eff = 8.784
